  "description" : "This dataset includes the estimated number of early childhood educators in the workforce across Massachusetts. Early childhood educator roles are available by licensing region and program type. Workforce data is collected bi-annually from the <a href=\"https://www.mass.gov/info-details/commonwealth-cares-for-children-c3-grants\"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Commonwealth Cares for Children (C3) </a>application. Note that the number of family child care licensees reflects the number of licensed family child care programs in the <a href=\"https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/Early-Education-and-Care-/Licensed-and-Funded-Child-Care-Providers/dn4d-tjbb/about_data\">Licensed and Funded Child Care Providers</a> dataset.\n\nThis data set is part of <a href=\"https://app.powerbigov.us/view?r=eyJrIjoiZmNlNjUwMmEtYzM1NC00OGU2LWIyYWQtMzg1MDk2MmE3MDJkIiwidCI6IjNlODYxZDE2LTQ4YjctNGEwZS05ODA2LThjMDRkODFiN2IyYSJ9&pageName=9949865fcf248b434d7d\"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">EEC's Key Performance Indicator (KPI) Dashboard</a>.",
